{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11113050","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11113050","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1111305001:0":{"text":"たいへん！このお姉ちゃんケガしてる！早く止血しないと、うちの薬草を使って！","source_cn":"哎呀，这位大姐姐怎么受伤了？得赶快止血才行！我家有草药！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1D28889085AECCE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1111305002:0":{"text":"ありがとう。君は優しい子だな……","source_cn":"谢谢，你真是个善良的孩子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F85A7E037A96066","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1111305003:0":{"text":"あれ？お母さん薬草をどこに置いたんだろ？探すから待っててね。","source_cn":"咦，妈妈把草药放哪了？我得好好找一找。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BF23BBB1AA9BA02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1111305004:0":{"text":"うーん……どこかな……","source_cn":"嗯……到底在哪呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7170223E6A6B8250","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111305005:0":{"text":"だめだ……お母さんがいないから家の中がごちゃごちゃで、全然みつからない……","source_cn":"不行啊……妈妈不在，家里乱糟糟的，什么都找不到……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5802EC861AF3B5A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_tit